7.1.1 Are memberships complete ?
Test if there are any assessments with total membership values below 1:

TASVEG_clean |&gt;
    group_by(VEGCODE, expert, round) |&gt;
    summarise(total = sum(memb), .groups = "drop") |&gt;
    filter(total &lt; 0.999) |&gt;
    arrange(total) |&gt;
